11
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:55,060
Separate activation magnitude from
inter-regional coupling.

12
00:00:55,060 --> 00:01:02,320
PPI provides a statistical framework to
test how psychological demands modulate

13
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:05,620
